ed: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260728-f503ea)\nReview cycle 2 verdict: changes requested; route to to-dev. P1: parseConsumers accepts duplicate known JSON members, so an earlier live-consumer list can be overridden by a later empty list, trusted, and rewritten empty, recreating the two-pass sweep hazard. P1: inspectUnexpected parent-binds and reads the receipt through handles but then reopens entryPath for the decisive Unix structure/hash classification; a root exchange in that window can validate a replacement and retire an unproven original. Focused, race, vet, format/diff, and full-tree Go gates pass. Full evidence: TASK-260720-1ljev5_review-verdict-cycle-2.md
